{
  "id": "00-welcome",
  "title": "Welcome — Aim for a plentiful harvest",
  "tenet": "Introduction",
  "durationMs": 73266,
  "audio": "narration-with-music.mp3",
  "text": "There comes a moment when faith must become more than something you believe. It must become the way you live: how you think, how you work, and how you treat people.\n\nBecause God did not plant a garden in you so that the soil could remain empty. Aim for a plentiful harvest.\n\nWelcome to SoulBuddy. Eight memorable Nuggets, seven tenets, and stories that help you carry the lessons into everyday life.\n\nLearn to pull the weeds early, and turn back to God when you fall. Remember Christ's victory, and fight with hope. Walk with the Holy Spirit, making room to pray and listen.\n\nPractice discipline, so your gifts become useful. Stay humble, and let what you have received become service. Seek God's heart through generosity, forgiveness, and love.\n\nAnd bear fruit. Feed someone. Encourage someone. Help someone carry what has become too heavy. Let goodness reach other people through your life.\n\nYou can skip for now, come back later, and continue from where you stopped. Listen again whenever you need the reminder.\n\nBegin where you are. Walk with God. And bear fruit: thirtyfold, sixtyfold, a hundredfold.\n\nPlant something good in the garden each day.",
